   <dc:contributor>Westbrook Mall</dc:contributor>
   <dc:contributor>Universidade Estadual Paulista (UNESP)</dc:contributor>
   <dc:description>We analyze non-rclativistic Limits of Podolsky generalized electrodynamics in the context of the 5-dimensional Galilean formalism. The &amp;apos;electric&amp;apos; and &amp;apos;magnetic&amp;apos; limits are studied in analogy with the work of Le Bellac and Levy-Leblond (1973). © 2009 World Scientific Publishing Co. Pte. Ltd.</dc:description>
